      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Reminded me of the folder request https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/folders-for-uploaded-avatars as if folders are added, a user could make a folder for avis they don't want to see.\n\nBut hiding certain avatar from the game is way easier to implement.\n\nThis would be even better for prolific avatar creators. Anything they want to put in an avatar world they might not necessarily want to see in thier in game list. I have observed some creators using secondary accounts",
