  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Sometimes you want to keep an avatar just in case you want to use it in the future for whatever reason, but you do not want to have it in the \"uploaded\" tabs in the game.\n\nThe reason why you do not delete those avatars is that you might want to use it in the future, but not right now and you do not want your Uploaded tab to be bloated.\n\nAlso, sometimes you do not even have the files anymore so you cannot upload it if again if you delete it.\n\nAdding a \"Hide ingame\" options on the website and possibly also in the SDK would help organising avatars.\n\nThis is especially an issue for people who have 100+ avatars uploaded.",
